# Simultaneous remainders (held-out spec FB-0353).
# expect: 2747 5005
# Merge congruences by searching the solutions already found.
list 5 7 11 13 end let moduli
list 2 3 8 4 end let remainders
0 let x
1 let period

0 moduli len range each
  let i
  moduli i at let modulus
  remainders i at let remainder
  begin
    x modulus mod remainder eq
    dup not if x period add let x then
  until
  # These moduli are pairwise coprime, so their lcm is their product.
  period modulus mul let period
end

x
period
